# What comes by its trigger on a computer (docs/motion.md, kind 2): a chat's row right-clicked, its menu growing out
# of the pointer; 接力到频道…, the menu gone at once and the dialog coming; Escape, the dialog gone at once. Then a new
# chat's model (its chip in the composer), its popover growing out of the chip; Escape. MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over the
# made-up chat.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 400
rightclick 整理发布清单
wait 600
tap 接力到频道…
wait 900
key escape
wait 600
tap 新建对话
until 新对话
wait 900
tapxy 620 490
wait 900
key escape
wait 700
exit
